<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>my food menu</title> 
  
  <style>
    body {
        font-family: cursive;
        background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom left, rgb(119, 204, 131), mediumseagreen, rgb(43, 130, 86));
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        padding: 30px;
        text-align: center;
    }

    h1 { color: beige;}

    h1 + p {
        background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgb(140, 140, 209), rgb(114, 182, 114));
        padding:  10px 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        color: cornsilk;
        display: inline-block;
    }

    ul { padding: 0; margin-top: 20px;}

    ul > li {
        list-style: none;
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: rgb(10, 86, 22);
        padding: 10px 20px;
        margin: 6px auto;
        width: 260px;
        background: rgb(170, 222, 178);
        border-radius: 8px;
    }

    ul li :nth-child(3) {
        background: rgb(63, 229, 135);
        color: rgb(2, 54, 17);
    }

    .desc  {
        color: mediumspringgreen;
        font-style: italic;
    }

    .desc::first-letter {
        font-size: medium;
        font-family: arial;
        font-style: normal;
        color: mediumturquoise;
        font-weight: bolder;
    }

    .links { margin-top: 25px;}

    a {
        color: teal;
        text-decoration: underline;
        font-size: large;
        border: 2px mediumslateblue;
        border-radius: 8px;
    }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>My food menu</h1>
    <p>pick your fav!!!!!!!!!!</p>

    <ul>
        <li>pizza</li>
         <li>ramen</li>
          <li>maggie - everyone loves this!</li>
           <li>munchurian</li>
            <li>pani puri</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="desc">Thank you so much for
         dining with us! We truly 
         appreciate your visit and 
         hope you enjoyed your meal 
         and your time with us. Your 
         support means a great deal 
         to our team, and we look 
         forward to welcoming you back
          again soon. Safe travels, 
          and see you next time!
</p>

<div class="links">
    <a href="#">order now!</a>
    <a href="#">see more</a>
</div>
</body>
</html>